  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="mise-adoption-heading">mise adoption</h2><a href="https://github.com/jdx/mise-analytics">Source: mise-analytics ↗</a></div>
  <p class="adoption-context">GitHub and Homebrew through {latest.date}. Homebrew counts installs of mise itself, including repeat installs—not unique users or tools installed with mise.</p>
